            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/non-archimedean+field"} non-archimedean field
          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ostrowski%27s+theorem"} Ostrowski's theorem
            says that these examples exhaust the non-trivial absolute values on the
            = succeed "." do
